==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's {{TCGP|Promo-A}} illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Celestial Storm|Kartana|101}} from the {{TCG|Celestial Storm}} expansion.
*The '''Thrash Metal''' attack is named after {{wp|thrash metal}}, a genre of music. The name may have been chosen in reference to {{p|Kartana}}'s {{t|Steel}} [[type]] in the [[core series games]]. Its Japanese attack name is デスラッシュ ''{{wp|Deathrash}}'', which contains スラッシュ ''Slash'', a possible reference to Kartana's UB designation of "UB04 Slash" in the Japanese version of the core series games.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Ultra Sun}}.

